{"title":"2005 AMC 10B Problems/Problem 17","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_2_(logarithms)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2 (logarithms)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Solution_3_(logarithm_chain_rule)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 3 (logarithm chain rule)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#See_Also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See Also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_17&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Suppose that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/1/b/f1b2b146eac185e50bd6e1099a0a7068818aa0ce.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4^a = 5$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"50\" height=\"13\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/4/7/b47f427f24438526c9d0f2a3c2c96bf8acdfb0b5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$5^b = 6$\" width=\"48\" height=\"15\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/0/6/d065c0dfd4b6cbacd2e4319feffdb7a9c7454786.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$6^c = 7$\" width=\"49\" height=\"12\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/d/7/cd715bbe11711e867a37e82d5a28f57e9b40df02.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$7^d = 8$\" width=\"49\" height=\"15\" />. What is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/a/9/5a9371a172ed578c06176a64e768b2204e234200.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a \\cdot b\\cdot c \\cdot d$\" width=\"74\" height=\"12\" />?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/f/9/bf9fe2a04632934af54b01c53c8132445783ab4f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A) } 1 \\qquad \\textbf{(B) } \\frac{3}{2} \\qquad \\textbf{(C) } 2 \\qquad \\textbf{(D) } \\frac{5}{2} \\qquad \\textbf{(E) } 3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"363\" height=\"38\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_17&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/0/6/306b5b6ee65ed4c01e70885f06e4a23c609239c2.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\begin{align*} 8&amp;=7^d \\\\ 8&amp;=\\left(6^c\\right)^d\\\\ 8&amp;=\\left(\\left(5^b\\right)^c\\right)^d\\\\ 8&amp;=\\left(\\left(\\left(4^a\\right)^b\\right)^c\\right)^d\\\\ 8&amp;=4^{a\\cdot b\\cdot c\\cdot d}\\\\ 2^3&amp;=2^{2\\cdot a\\cdot b\\cdot c\\cdot d}\\\\ 3&amp;=2\\cdot a\\cdot b\\cdot c\\cdot d\\\\ a\\cdot b\\cdot c\\cdot d&amp;=\\boxed{\\textbf{(B) }\\dfrac{3}{2}}\\\\ \\end{align*}\" width=\"194\" height=\"273\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Solution_2_.28logarithms.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2_(logarithms)\">Solution 2 (<a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Logarithms\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Logarithms\">logarithms</a>)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_17&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2 (logarithms)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>We can write <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/d/c7d457e388298246adb06c587bccd419ea67f7e8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" /> as <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/b/a/7ba9ffad807eb7cd8e63f17bd75b307cda762ee8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\log_4 5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"42\" height=\"17\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/1/3/8136a7ef6a03334a7246df9097e5bcc31ba33fd2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"14\" /> as <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/c/8/6c8455cc076dd1da4ba0ba60a1b7857d2b07cd44.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\log_5 6$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"42\" height=\"17\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/3/7/3372c1cb6d68cf97c2d231acc0b47b95a9ed04cc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$c$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"10\" /> as <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/5/1/b517a95b6fd96922a29960209417947c62cbe6b3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\log_6 7$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"43\" height=\"17\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/6/a/96ab646de7704969b91c76a214126b45f2b07b25.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$d$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> as <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/2/d/42d79271be54015b8f5ad9d551fb707302b921bf.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\log_7 8$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"42\" height=\"17\" />. \n</p><p>We know that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/a/b/2aba777fd992fd3f377364f9ee87b24eb98e89b2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\log_b a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"45\" height=\"19\" /> can be rewritten as <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/2/b/d2bd59a07d6f5bbb13ae4a7f885113db66f2ac2c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{\\log a}{\\log b}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -16px\" width=\"38\" height=\"41\" />, so we have:\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/d/5/1d5351ff3b806240ba48e436563ca22a8127791e.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\begin{align*} a\\cdot b \\cdot c \\cdot d &amp;= \\frac{\\cancel{\\log5}}{\\log4}\\cdot\\frac{\\cancel{\\log6}}{\\cancel{\\log5}}\\cdot\\frac{\\cancel{\\log7}}{\\cancel{\\log6}}\\cdot\\frac{\\log8}{\\cancel{\\log7}} \\\\ a\\cdot b \\cdot c \\cdot d &amp;= \\frac{\\log8}{\\log4} \\\\ a\\cdot b \\cdot c \\cdot d &amp;= \\frac{3\\cancel{\\log2}}{2\\cancel{\\log2}} \\\\ a\\cdot b \\cdot c \\cdot d &amp;= \\boxed{\\textbf{(B) }\\frac{3}{2}} \\\\ \\end{align*}\" width=\"295\" height=\"194\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Solution_3_.28logarithm_chain_rule.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_3_(logarithm_chain_rule)\">Solution 3 (logarithm chain rule)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_17&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 3 (logarithm chain rule)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>As in Solution 2, we can write <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/d/c7d457e388298246adb06c587bccd419ea67f7e8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" /> as <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/b/a/7ba9ffad807eb7cd8e63f17bd75b307cda762ee8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\log_4 5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"42\" height=\"17\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/1/3/8136a7ef6a03334a7246df9097e5bcc31ba33fd2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"14\" /> as <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/f/9/0f9ea90c0ed7e64438372287c52cfe95d0932b67.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\log_56$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"42\" height=\"17\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/3/7/3372c1cb6d68cf97c2d231acc0b47b95a9ed04cc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$c$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"10\" /> as <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/9/6/496d84a3bfd998166abadea3cbf347162639eaa0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\log_67$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"43\" height=\"17\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/6/a/96ab646de7704969b91c76a214126b45f2b07b25.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$d$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> as <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/c/b/1cb8748c988139db27483589c7410f8d7caa2a21.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\log_78$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"42\" height=\"17\" />. <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/8/4/f8488f9d146cadbbcb3825d747b8652f26a5fb7b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a\\cdot b\\cdot c\\cdot d$\" width=\"74\" height=\"12\" /> is equivalent to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/2/a/42aaf85ef2870064d83541cd85b38ecdcb931435.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(\\log_4 5)\\cdot (\\log_5 6)\\cdot (\\log_6 7)\\cdot (\\log_7 8)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"270\" height=\"20\" />. By the logarithm chain rule, this is equivalent to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/1/7/f179b96fce9163ea9a2a38236e27150beed07b40.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\log_4 8$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"42\" height=\"17\" />, which evaluates to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/a/2/ea2fb198fdb9451996304e46f1c41479c18f19c6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(B) }\\frac{3}{2}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -19px\" width=\"61\" height=\"49\" />.\n</p><p>~solver1104\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_17&amp;action=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_AMC_10B\" title=\"2005 AMC 10B\">2005 AMC 10B</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_AMC_10B_Problems\" title=\"2005 AMC 10B Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_AMC_10B_Answer_Key\" title=\"2005 AMC 10B Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/community/c13\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_16\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"2005 AMC 10B Problems/Problem 16\">Problem 16</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_18\" title=\"2005 AMC 10B Problems/Problem 18\">Problem 18</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_1\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"2005 AMC 10B Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_2\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"2005 AMC 10B Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"2005 AMC 10B Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"2005 AMC 10B Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wi